[[FSE STAGE type=flexible width=10 depth=10]]
[[FSE ENTITY door type=entrance pos=-5,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY horatio type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY hamlet type=cast pos=0,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY lantern type=prop]]
[[FSE ENTITY trolley type=prop]]
[[FSE ENTITY cup type=prop on=trolley]]
[[FSE ENTITY label type=prop label="A \"quoted\" label; with a semicolon" on=cup]]

INT. HALL

[[FSE SET lantern with=horatio]]
[[FSE ENTER horatio from=door pos=-1,0]]

HORATIO
(raising the lantern)
[[FSE SET lantern pos=-0.5,0 by=horatio]] My lord.

[[FSE ENTER trolley from=door]]
[[FSE MOVE trolley pos=-4,0 by=crew]]
[[FSE SET cup with=hamlet]]

HAMLET
[[FSE SET cup on=trolley]] Thank you.
